# "While creatures you control have total power 8 or greater" (CR 508.3d): La'An Noonien-Singh (4) and Centaur Courser (3)
# attack for 7, one short, so the ability does not trigger and no target is asked (`! Bot1.Target`). Bot2's Llanowar Elves
# block the Courser and are allowed to, and Bot1's other attacker deals 4 to Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
La'An Noonien-Singh, Security
Centaur Courser
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.La'An Noonien-Singh, Security.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
